	(14123, 5, 'f_12697542026_08_21.jpg', NULL, 'Office security', 'General clining', 'A general cleaning was carried out in the security office area, covering the office itself, restrooms, internal hallways, and windows. Doors were cleaned, and weeds sprouting from the floor—including those around the fountain—were cleared away. Cobwebs were also removed from the ceilings and from both the interior and exterior walls.', 'creado', NULL, 5, 234, '2026-08-21 11:24:35'),
	(14124, 5, 'f_38860152026_08_21.jpg', NULL, 'Club house ', 'General clining', 'A general cleaning of the clubhouse was carried out, covering the main and secondary lounges, stairs, elevator, gym, restrooms, and both internal and external corridors; cobwebs were cleared from the exterior doors, and weeds growing in the outdoor walkways were removed. Additionally, the air filters were replaced, and the urinal deodorizer in the men\'s restroom was changed.', 'creado', NULL, 5, 234, '2026-08-21 11:54:13'),
