	(14129, 5, 'f_49096272026_08_21.jpg', NULL, 'Pool', 'General clining', 'A general cleaning was carried out in the pool area, covering the main lounge, living area, restrooms, showers, and hallways, as well as the tables, umbrellas, and reclining chairs. Leaves were removed from the pool and cobwebs cleared from the ceilings; a burnt-out lightbulb was replaced, and everything was tidied up to ensure a better presentation for those using the area this weekend.', 'creado', NULL, 5, 234, '2026-08-21 15:04:30'),
	(14130, 5, 'f_25262072026_08_21.jpg', NULL, 'Park', 'General clining', 'A general cleanup of the park area is carried out, removing all cobwebs from the mesh, chairs, main attraction, swings, and tables. Branches and weeds are cleared from the ground beneath the swings and the main park area. Trash is organized, and everything is left clean and looking better than when we found it.', 'finalizado', 234, 5, 234, '2026-08-21 15:13:46'),
