	(15273, 5, 'f_31873952026_10_16.jpg', NULL, 'Club house ', 'General clining', 'At the clubhouse, general cleaning is performed in the main room, secondary room, stairwell, gym, and restrooms. Additionally, cobwebs are cleared from the exterior areas around the doors on both the first and second floors, and a leaf blower is used to remove leaves from the parking area and external walkways.', 'creado', NULL, 5, 234, '2026-10-16 14:36:39'),
