	(15299, 5, 'f_39060172026_10_19.jpg', NULL, 'Club house ', 'General clining', 'A general cleaning is performed in the Clubhouse area, covering the main lounge, secondary lounge, stairs, gym, restrooms, and internal hallways. Cobwebs are removed from doors, mirrors are straightened, and windows are cleaned. A leaf blower is also used to clear leaves from the parking areas and walkways, ensuring a fresh and clean environment.', 'creado', NULL, 5, 234, '2026-10-19 15:47:25'),
	(15300, 5, 'f_14507172026_10_19.jpg', NULL, 'Pool', 'General clining', 'A general cleaning was carried out in the pool area, which included cleaning the showers, restrooms, central lounge, sun loungers, umbrellas, and tables. Chairs were organized, furniture was arranged, and leaves were removed from the pool. Additionally, weeds were cleared from the ground, a special cleaning solution was applied, and a leaf blower was used to remove seeds and debris from the area. The exterior walkway was also cleaned, and trash bins were emptied, ensuring a clean environment for', 'creado', NULL, 5, 234, '2026-10-19 15:48:01'),
	(15301, 5, 'f_45515702026_10_19.jpg', NULL, 'Park', 'General clining', 'A general cleanup was carried out in the park area. Cobwebs were removed from the main attraction and the swings, and weeds were cleared from the ground. Trash and branches scattered around the area were collected, and a leaf blower was used to clean both the outer and inner pathways, ensuring a pleasant environment and a tidy appearance for visitors and residents of the property.', 'creado', NULL, 5, 234, '2026-10-19 15:48:30'),
	(15302, 5, 'f_4028172026_10_19.jpg', NULL, 'Office security', 'General clining', 'A general cleaning was carried out in the security office, including the ceilings, columns, and doors; cobwebs were removed from around the pipes, and weeds were cleared from the ground area and around the fountain. The interior of the office—including the restrooms, countertops, floor mats, and windows—was also cleaned and organized to create a better environment for those working in this part of the property.', 'creado', NULL, 5, 234, '2026-10-19 15:48:59'),
